{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-job-20-1","title":"Job 20:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Zophar shews the state and portion of the wicked.</p>\n<p>Zophar. 2:11; 11:1; 42:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-2","title":"Job 20:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>my thoughts. 3; 4:2; 13:19; 32:13-20; Ps 39:2,3; Jer 20:9; Ro 10:2 and for. Ps 31:22; 116:11; Pr 14:29; 29:20; Ec 7:9; Mr 6:25; Jas 1:19 I make haste. Heb. my haste is in me.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-3","title":"Job 20:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the check. 19:29 the spirit. 2; 27:11; 33:3; Ps 49:3; 78:2-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-4","title":"Job 20:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>thou not. 8:8,9; 15:10; 32:7 man. Ge 1:28; 9:1-3; Ps 115:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-5","title":"Job 20:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>the triumphing. 5:3; 15:29-34; 18:5,6; 27:13-23; Ex 15:9,10; Jud 16:21-30 Es 5:11,12; 7:10; Ps 37:35,36; 73:18-20; Ac 12:22,23 short. Heb. from near. the joy. 8:19; 27:8; Mt 7:21; 13:20,21; Ga 6:4; Jas 4:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-6","title":"Job 20:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>his excellency. Ge 11:4; Isa 14:13,14; Da 4:11,22; Am 9:2; Ob 1:3,4; Mt 11:23 clouds. Heb. cloud.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-7","title":"Job 20:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>perish. 1Ki 14:10; 2Ki 9:37; Ps 83:10; Jer 8:2 shall say. 14:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-8","title":"Job 20:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>fly away. Ps 73:20; 18:10; 90:5; Isa 29:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-9","title":"Job 20:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>The eye. 7; 7:8,10; 8:18; 27:3; Ps 37:10,36; 103:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-10","title":"Job 20:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>His children, etc. or, The poor shall oppress his children. Pr 28:3 seek. Ps 109:10 his hands. 18; Ex 12:36; 22:1,3; 9:2; 2Sa 12:6; Pr 6:31; Lu 19:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-11","title":"Job 20:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>bones. 13:26; 19:20; Ps 25:7; Pr 5:11-13,22,23; Eze 32:27 which shall lie. 21:26; Pr 14:32; Eze 24:13; Joh 8:21,24; Ac 1:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-12","title":"Job 20:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>wickedness. 15:16; Ge 3:6; Pr 9:17,18; 20:17; Ec 11:9 he hide. Ps 10:7; 109:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-13","title":"Job 20:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>spare it. Mt 5:29,30; Mr 9:43-49; Ro 8:13 within his mouth. Heb. in the midst of his palate.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-14","title":"Job 20:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>his meat. 2Sa 11:2-5; 12:10,11; Ps 32:3,4; 38:1-8; 51:8,9; Pr 1:31 Pr 23:20,21,29-35; Jer 2:19; Mal 2:2 the gall. 16; De 32:24; Ro 3:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-15","title":"Job 20:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>swallowed. Pr 23:8; Mt 27:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-16","title":"Job 20:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>the poison. Ro 3:13 the viper's. Isa 30:6; Mt 3:7; Ac 28:3-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-17","title":"Job 20:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>shall not see. Nu 14:23; 2Ki 7:2; Jer 17:6-8; Lu 16:24 the rivers. Ps 36:8,9; Isa 41:17; Jer 17:6; Re 22:1 floods. or, streaming brooks. of honey. De 32:13,14; 2Sa 17:29; Ps 81:16; Isa 7:15,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-18","title":"Job 20:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>shall he restore. 10,15 swallow. 5; Pr 1:12; Jer 51:34,44; La 2:16; Ho 8:7,8; Am 8:4; Mt 23:14,24 his substance. Heb. the substance of his exchange. and heshall. 31:25,29; Isa 24:7-11; Jer 11:15,16; 22:13,17; Eze 7:12; Ho 9:1 Jas 4:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-19","title":"Job 20:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Because. 21:27,28; 22:6; 24:2-12; 31:13-22,38,39; 35:9; 1Sa 12:3,4; Ps 10:18 Ps 12:5; Pr 14:31; 22:22,23; Ec 4:1; 5:8; Eze 22:29; Am 4:1-3 Jas 2:6,13; 5:4 oppressed. Heb. crushed. De 28:33; La 3:34 he hath violently. 18:15; 24:2; 1Ki 21:19; Isa 5:7,8; Mic 2:2,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-20","title":"Job 20:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Surely. Ec 5:13,14; Isa 57:20,21 feel. Heb. know.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-21","title":"Job 20:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>none of his meat be left. or, be none left for his meat. 18:19; Jer 17:11; Lu 16:24,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-22","title":"Job 20:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>the fulness. 15:29; 18:7; Ps 39:5; Ec 2:18-20; Re 18:7 every hand. 1:15,17; 16:11; 2Ki 24:2; Isa 10:6 wicked. or, troublesome. 3:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-23","title":"Job 20:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>he is about. Nu 11:33; Ps 78:30,31; Mal 2:2; Lu 12:17-20 rain it. Ge 19:24; Ex 9:23; Ps 11:6; 78:30,31; Isa 21:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-24","title":"Job 20:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>flee from. 1Ki 20:30; Isa 24:18; Jer 48:43,44; Am 5:19; 9:1-3 the bow. 2Sa 22:35 strike him. Pr 7:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-25","title":"Job 20:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>drawn. 16:13; De 32:41; 2Sa 18:14; Ps 7:12 terrors. 6:4; 15:21; 18:11; 27:20; Ps 73:19; 88:15; Jer 20:3,4; 2Co 5:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-26","title":"Job 20:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>darkness. 18:5,6; Isa 8:22; Mt 8:12; Jude 1:13 a fire. Ps 21:9; 120:4; Isa 30:33; Mt 3:12 it shall go. 18:19; Ps 109:9-15; Isa 14:20-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-27","title":"Job 20:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>heaven. Ps 44:20,21; Jer 29:23; Mal 3:5; Lu 12:2,3; Ro 2:16; 1Co 4:5 earth. 16:18; 18:18; Isa 26:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-28","title":"Job 20:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>increase. 10,18-22; 5:5; 27:14-19; 2Ki 20:17; Re 18:17 and his goods. Pr 11:4; Zep 1:18; Mt 16:26; Jas 5:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-20-29","title":"Job 20:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>the portion. 18:21; 27:13; 31:2,3; De 29:20-28; Ps 11:5,6; Mt 24:51 appointed unto him by God. Heb. of his decree from God. La 3:38</p>"}]}